WEBVTT

01:38.160 --> 01:41.000
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.050 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 2]

01:49.680 --> 01:50.710
What is this?

01:54.039 --> 01:55.110
Now take a look

01:55.410 --> 01:56.210
and see if you can see it.

02:07.030 --> 02:07.670
It's okay.

02:08.320 --> 02:09.039
Don't be afraid.

03:13.530 --> 03:14.830
You're a demon hunter.

03:15.220 --> 03:16.940
You won't leave us alone, right?

03:18.200 --> 03:20.390
Mountain demons won't hurt the living.

03:29.440 --> 03:30.670
It's fate that we meet.

03:31.210 --> 03:31.900
The mountain demons values fate

03:31.930 --> 03:33.100
more than we do.

03:33.670 --> 03:34.829
This is their way of welcoming you.

03:35.910 --> 03:37.070
Are you refusing their toast?

03:37.430 --> 03:38.430
You're going to have to drink a forfeit.

04:46.680 --> 04:47.560
Don't waste it.

04:48.400 --> 04:49.400
It can help prolong your life.

04:55.920 --> 04:57.880
Were those mountain demons?

04:58.390 --> 04:59.800
A mountain can also become a demon?

05:03.590 --> 05:04.850
From the mountains, rivers, sun and moon,

05:05.080 --> 05:06.350
to the flowers, birds and insects.

05:06.880 --> 05:08.150
As long as one receives a primordial spirit,

05:08.390 --> 05:09.560
they can then train to become a demon.

05:10.510 --> 05:11.200
To put it bluntly,

05:11.630 --> 05:12.760
isn't it the same for humans?

05:13.320 --> 05:14.270
If you remain unenlightened,

05:14.680 --> 05:16.320
we are just a mess of flesh and blood.

05:17.070 --> 05:17.950
When you have gained enlightenment,

05:18.240 --> 05:19.390
you'll then know the rules of etiquette,

05:19.640 --> 05:20.430
talk about what is shameful,

05:20.750 --> 05:21.540
tell the right from the wrong,

05:21.950 --> 05:24.270
and ascend to a throne above all beings.

05:39.150 --> 05:40.350
What is primordial spirit?

05:41.000 --> 05:43.150
It's a sacred object of the demon clan.

05:44.150 --> 05:45.470
You can think of it as a seed.

05:46.000 --> 05:47.710
If you get it, you can become smarter,

05:48.240 --> 05:49.270
practice sorcery,

05:49.440 --> 05:50.440
and prolong your life.

05:51.070 --> 05:51.830
Furthermore,

05:52.270 --> 05:53.390
one can control the wind and rain

05:53.900 --> 05:54.760
and metamorphose into a human being.

06:01.710 --> 06:02.950
Can you sell me

06:02.950 --> 06:03.880
that bottle of the medicine

06:05.460 --> 06:07.100
which you just gave me?

06:10.670 --> 06:12.060
You want to let your cousin try it?

06:17.230 --> 06:18.320
You can't use it even if I give it to you.

06:19.070 --> 06:20.680
The reason why I helped to unblock your vision just now

06:21.150 --> 06:22.560
is because you have a unique physique.

06:23.470 --> 06:24.560
But for others,

06:25.150 --> 06:26.470
knowing that there are demons on earth

06:26.950 --> 06:28.150
may not necessarily be a good thing.

06:29.510 --> 06:30.830
Do you have any other ways

06:30.830 --> 06:32.560
that will allow Yanqiu to stay safe?

06:35.760 --> 06:36.860
Get rid of that menace

06:36.880 --> 06:37.550
in your family.

06:38.800 --> 06:40.620
That demon is called the Human-faced Owl.

06:40.760 --> 06:42.150
It's a rather old demon.

06:42.880 --> 06:43.890
It has a human face with a beast's body,

06:44.050 --> 06:45.050
like a dog's tail on a horse's body,

06:45.360 --> 06:46.280
but with a physical form of an owl.

06:47.070 --> 06:48.300
The legendary Human-faced Owl

06:48.590 --> 06:49.800
is a sign of major disaster.

06:50.180 --> 06:50.810
If you see it,

06:50.960 --> 06:51.870
there will be severe drought in the region.

06:52.920 --> 06:53.390
However,

06:53.390 --> 06:54.510
those are just rumors.

06:54.820 --> 06:56.140
The Human-faced Owl I saw

06:56.320 --> 06:57.630
was just like any other demon.

06:58.270 --> 06:59.630
They are just good at changing.

06:59.800 --> 07:00.800
It likes to eat the human throat.

07:01.670 --> 07:02.720
Every time it eats up a throat,

07:03.150 --> 07:04.860
the Human-faced Owl can possess the person's voice

07:05.060 --> 07:05.860
and mimic its sound.

07:06.770 --> 07:07.800
That's why Human-faced Owl

07:07.880 --> 07:09.290
can vocalize a hundred tones in one voice.

07:09.640 --> 07:10.590
It smells strange

07:10.850 --> 07:11.900
and it is very horrible.

07:12.610 --> 07:14.200
This medicine is called Bitter Throat.

07:14.510 --> 07:15.560
It can keep your cousin's life safe

07:15.560 --> 07:16.560
for the time being.

07:35.390 --> 07:36.150
That demon

07:36.180 --> 07:36.850
must have set her eyes on

07:36.870 --> 07:38.020
your cousin’s voice.

07:38.440 --> 07:39.390
She has previously hurt people

07:39.420 --> 07:40.220
at Guangping.

07:40.560 --> 07:42.040
She bit the throat of the people

07:42.350 --> 07:43.800
whose voices she wanted to possess.

07:43.880 --> 07:46.560
[Duan's Mansion]

07:43.980 --> 07:45.350
I followed it all the way here

07:45.620 --> 07:47.020
just so that I could get rid of this menace.

07:47.550 --> 07:49.020
I didn't expect your cousin

07:49.190 --> 07:50.340
to mistake me as the murderer.

07:50.790 --> 07:51.670
If he hadn't been busy

07:51.690 --> 07:52.960
looking for me these few days

07:52.990 --> 07:53.720
and thus did not return home...

07:54.000 --> 07:54.590
Young Master.

07:54.650 --> 07:56.880
I'm afraid that demon would have gotten to him.

07:59.440 --> 08:00.150
My Lady, My Lady!

08:00.210 --> 08:01.160
Young Master is back.

08:01.590 --> 08:02.230
Yes.

08:03.030 --> 08:03.570
Let's hurry.

08:08.090 --> 08:09.090
Are you okay, My Lady?

08:09.760 --> 08:10.360
I'm fine.

08:10.880 --> 08:11.470
Hurry.

08:11.500 --> 08:12.240
Let's serve it now.

08:12.270 --> 08:12.780
Okay.

08:14.960 --> 08:15.840
Yanqiu.

08:17.150 --> 08:17.730
Banxia.

08:19.610 --> 08:20.440
You're back.

08:21.860 --> 08:23.150
Did you manage to catch the bad guy?

08:25.320 --> 08:26.680
The authorities have casted a wide net.

08:27.130 --> 08:28.400
We'll catch them alive sooner or later.

08:30.240 --> 08:31.150
You don't have to worry.

08:32.130 --> 08:32.940
Anything else?

08:34.580 --> 08:36.740
I noticed that you haven't been looking good lately.

08:37.150 --> 08:38.080
I made some

08:38.100 --> 08:39.100
tonic for you.

08:39.409 --> 08:40.600
Drink it while it's hot.

08:46.380 --> 08:46.930
Thank you,

08:47.310 --> 08:47.950
but no need.

08:49.570 --> 08:50.330
Young Master,

08:50.700 --> 08:52.020
please just take a sip.

08:52.790 --> 08:53.870
She went to Jishi Clinic

08:53.870 --> 08:54.990
early in the morning,

08:55.440 --> 08:56.160
then cleaned and boiled the tonic

08:56.160 --> 08:57.400
for more than half the day.

08:58.180 --> 08:59.540
She even scalded her hand.

08:59.990 --> 09:01.080
She has put a lot of effort into it.

09:01.830 --> 09:02.710
You scalded yourself?

09:04.070 --> 09:04.830
Have you applied any medicine?

09:05.100 --> 09:06.060
Should we get a doctor?

09:06.450 --> 09:07.210
Yes, I have.

09:08.210 --> 09:09.330
It's okay.

09:10.170 --> 09:12.720
You should take the tonic while it's hot.

09:22.490 --> 09:23.160
What tonic is this?

09:23.550 --> 09:24.430
Why is it so bitter?

09:25.350 --> 09:26.710
Good medicine always tastes bitter.

09:27.790 --> 09:29.480
They said it will only work

09:29.660 --> 09:30.940
if you drink up to the last drop.

09:38.520 --> 09:39.210
Thank you.

09:40.940 --> 09:41.650
I'm leaving.

10:34.940 --> 10:35.900
Bitter Throat?

10:50.460 --> 10:51.060
My Lady,

10:51.530 --> 10:52.480
come and wash your face.

11:02.300 --> 11:02.780
My Lady,

11:02.910 --> 11:03.510
are you cold?

11:08.970 --> 11:09.610
I'm fine.

11:12.760 --> 11:13.800
It's getting late.

11:13.830 --> 11:14.830
You should go wash up and sleep.

11:16.290 --> 11:17.090
I'm not sleepy yet.

11:17.390 --> 11:18.270
You can go and sleep first.

11:42.480 --> 11:42.960
Elder Madam,

11:42.980 --> 11:44.140
Young Madam is here to greet you.

11:46.960 --> 11:47.960
Let her in.

11:48.640 --> 11:49.320
Yes.

12:05.050 --> 12:06.140
Man'er sends her greetings

12:07.090 --> 12:08.160
to Grandmother

12:09.750 --> 12:10.400
and Mother-in-Law.

12:11.380 --> 12:12.320
Rise.

12:12.950 --> 12:13.830
Thank you, Grandmother.

12:19.520 --> 12:20.710
I'm useless.

12:21.230 --> 12:22.110
I've been sick for the past two days

12:23.110 --> 12:24.990
and hence couldn't pay respects to Grandmother and Mother-in-Law.

12:25.660 --> 12:26.660
Please forgive me.

12:27.400 --> 12:29.120
There was a thief in the house that day.

12:29.230 --> 12:31.060
Qiu said you were frightened.

12:31.640 --> 12:33.090
Are you okay now?

12:34.440 --> 12:35.640
Thanks for your concern.

12:36.070 --> 12:36.950
I am okay now.

12:38.590 --> 12:39.830
Although we are not

12:39.830 --> 12:41.040
a very rich family

12:41.280 --> 12:43.560
and we may not have as many formalities,

12:44.110 --> 12:45.660
we should at least observe

12:45.680 --> 12:47.040
basic etiquette.

12:48.060 --> 12:49.600
Since you have married into our family,

12:49.750 --> 12:51.750
forget about what happened in the past.

12:52.330 --> 12:54.260
You have to be hardworking and thrift,

12:54.280 --> 12:55.590
follow the rules and observe the rituals,

12:55.920 --> 12:57.990
and take good care of your husband.

12:58.350 --> 12:59.520
Don't let down

12:59.880 --> 13:01.830
his love for you.

13:03.870 --> 13:04.990
You're right, Grandmother.

13:05.830 --> 13:06.870
I have remembered that.

13:07.680 --> 13:08.560
Sit over there.

13:10.440 --> 13:11.590
Yes, Grandmother.

13:24.920 --> 13:26.190
I heard from my husband that

13:27.070 --> 13:28.190
you gave him a bowl of tonic

13:28.320 --> 13:29.710
yesterday.

13:30.370 --> 13:31.370
He was very appreciative of it.

13:32.350 --> 13:33.040
I was wondering

13:33.040 --> 13:34.870
where did you get this panacea?

13:35.350 --> 13:37.070
Can you lend me the prescription to copy?

13:39.950 --> 13:41.520
If you need it,

13:42.190 --> 13:43.590
I can write a copy for you.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.470
You are so kind.

13:47.280 --> 13:47.870
How about

13:47.870 --> 13:49.400
you drop by my room later?

13:50.020 --> 13:50.660
No need.

13:50.870 --> 13:51.800
I have something to do today.

13:51.930 --> 13:52.970
What is it?

13:56.950 --> 13:58.070
A few days ago,

13:58.440 --> 14:00.110
I saw that Father's hair had turned white.

14:01.400 --> 14:02.950
I want to buy some black beans

14:03.110 --> 14:04.070
and fry them into dried beans,

14:04.470 --> 14:05.590
so that Father can dye his hair.

14:06.440 --> 14:07.790
You are so thoughtful.

14:08.220 --> 14:09.670
Your father is blessed,

14:11.590 --> 14:12.990
unlike me and your uncle.

14:19.310 --> 14:20.070
Grandmother,

14:20.370 --> 14:21.610
I'll take my leave.

14:27.160 --> 14:27.710
Xuanye,

14:28.370 --> 14:29.160
without you,

14:29.640 --> 14:30.920
can Manniang

14:30.920 --> 14:31.750
handle it all by herself?

14:32.780 --> 14:33.710
She's fine during the day.

14:33.930 --> 14:34.690
There are many people around her.

14:37.090 --> 14:38.230
Do you remember

14:38.290 --> 14:39.130
what I told you?

14:40.140 --> 14:40.690
Yes.

14:45.910 --> 14:46.320
Xuanye,

14:46.580 --> 14:47.280
your rival.

14:50.770 --> 14:52.070
He's pretty fast with his actions.

14:52.520 --> 14:53.640
Let me help you deal with him.

14:54.250 --> 14:55.160
Go back first.

14:55.550 --> 14:56.470
I don't need you here.

14:57.110 --> 14:58.350
Don't forget what's going to happen tonight.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.510
Long time no see, Physician Jiu.

15:10.920 --> 15:11.590
Every time I see you,

15:11.620 --> 15:13.100
you are either eating or drinking.

15:14.070 --> 15:14.920
How relaxed.

15:16.560 --> 15:18.750
Well, I can't compare against you, Chief Constable Chu,

15:19.240 --> 15:20.160
who is always running around energetically.

15:21.480 --> 15:22.440
I am just working hard.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.340
I got lost on my way here

15:25.370 --> 15:26.130
and was delayed for two days.

15:26.710 --> 15:28.020
Is this one of your tricks, Physician Jiu?

15:29.930 --> 15:30.810
In your heart,

15:30.840 --> 15:32.240
am I not a swindler?

15:32.750 --> 15:33.990
How could that be considered at trick?

15:34.410 --> 15:37.520
[Chief Constable of Guangping City, Chu Youhuang]

15:36.950 --> 15:37.680
Show me your

15:37.680 --> 15:38.520
travel documents.

15:39.470 --> 15:40.110
I don't have it.

15:40.750 --> 15:41.680
You don't have it?

15:42.950 --> 15:45.160
All travelers and horses that come in and out

15:45.250 --> 15:47.040
must be checked accordingly for their documents.

15:47.590 --> 15:48.750
If you don't have it, that means you have crossed illegally.

15:49.670 --> 15:50.570
If so, I have to

15:50.590 --> 15:51.630
take you back to Guangping City.

15:52.730 --> 15:54.680
Well, isn't my lack of travel documents

15:55.280 --> 15:56.990
all thanks do your doing?

15:58.190 --> 15:59.520
I am just working according to the law.

15:59.990 --> 16:01.920
According to the law,

16:02.760 --> 16:05.130
those who are in currently enlisted or have committed crimes,

16:05.520 --> 16:07.160
will not be issued with the travel pass.

16:14.270 --> 16:15.320
Physician Jiu,

16:16.020 --> 16:17.550
do you still remember

16:17.570 --> 16:18.640
the six murder cases

16:19.480 --> 16:20.690
at Changping Alley, along Sifang Street?

16:27.710 --> 16:28.640
Don't be nervous.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.800
I didn't track you here this time around.

16:32.640 --> 16:33.560
The bandit who cut throats

16:33.560 --> 16:34.470
has fled to Nanyang.

16:35.030 --> 16:35.830
I'm here to investigate the case.

16:36.950 --> 16:38.110
But isn't it such a coincidence?

16:38.910 --> 16:39.910
Whenever there is a murder,

16:40.590 --> 16:41.920
you are always around.

16:42.570 --> 16:43.270
Physician Jiu,

16:43.290 --> 16:44.220
you seem to like to join in the fun.

16:45.640 --> 16:47.400
The throat-cutting cases were the actions of a demon.

16:47.710 --> 16:48.680
You can't handle it.

16:49.640 --> 16:50.350
Again, a demon?

16:51.200 --> 16:51.920
Just like how six years ago,

16:51.920 --> 16:53.400
your entire family

16:53.690 --> 16:54.810
was killed by demons?

16:55.400 --> 16:56.470
I'm just a mere mortal.

16:56.470 --> 16:57.320
I can't see through deception.

16:58.470 --> 16:59.870
Even if I know you had committed murder,

16:59.870 --> 17:01.230
I was unable to convict you.

17:02.800 --> 17:04.310
I don't buy the same lies

17:04.990 --> 17:06.079
that others believe in.

17:07.230 --> 17:07.880
Chief Constable Chu,

17:08.440 --> 17:09.160
I have said

17:09.160 --> 17:10.200
all that I wanted to say.

17:10.839 --> 17:12.470
If you get hurt or even die

17:12.880 --> 17:14.560
because you insist on trying,

17:15.510 --> 17:16.359
don't come blaming me instead.

17:23.550 --> 17:24.119
Waiter!

17:24.839 --> 17:25.470
I will have the bill.

17:25.619 --> 17:26.510
Okay, please wait a moment.

17:27.230 --> 17:28.230
You can order

17:28.230 --> 17:29.400
something for yourself to eat.

17:31.990 --> 17:32.710
Thank you.

17:34.470 --> 17:37.130
[Nanyang City Government]

18:12.560 --> 18:13.270
Help!

18:14.510 --> 18:15.180
Anyone? Help!

18:18.250 --> 18:19.490
Why are you going out so late?

18:21.080 --> 18:21.710
Father.

18:22.210 --> 18:23.530
The scoundrel has appeared in the government office.

18:24.080 --> 18:25.080
Be careful.

18:25.950 --> 18:27.100
Do you have enough people with you?

18:27.120 --> 18:27.640
How about

18:27.710 --> 18:29.200
bringing all of our guards there?

18:29.680 --> 18:30.310
No need.

18:31.230 --> 18:31.640
Let's go.

18:32.920 --> 18:33.920
Hurry. Follow them.

18:34.160 --> 18:34.600
Yes.

18:34.650 --> 18:35.500
Protect Young Master!

18:58.030 --> 19:04.790
♫There is grass in the wild♫

19:06.390 --> 19:12.650
♫Dewdrops sparkle atop♫

19:14.440 --> 19:18.340
♫There is a beauty♫

19:18.360 --> 19:21.730
♫Elegant and beautiful♫

19:22.560 --> 19:24.500
♫I met her by coincidence♫

19:24.520 --> 19:29.250
♫My wish is fulfilled♫

19:30.970 --> 19:37.860
♫There is grass in the wild♫

19:39.220 --> 19:46.140
♫Dewdrops sparkle atop♫

19:47.240 --> 19:50.790
♫There is a beauty♫

19:50.820 --> 19:54.910
♫Elegant and beautiful♫

19:55.370 --> 19:57.920
♫I met her by coincidence♫

19:57.960 --> 20:03.470
♫I hope we could be together♫

20:07.790 --> 20:08.950
What happened?

20:09.440 --> 20:10.230
My Lady,

20:10.750 --> 20:11.640
Young Master went out.

20:11.950 --> 20:12.950
Other than the Elder Master,

20:12.980 --> 20:14.300
every other male has followed him out.

20:17.680 --> 20:18.550
What's happening?

20:21.340 --> 20:21.970
Tingzhou?

20:23.120 --> 20:23.750
Tingzhou!

20:24.680 --> 20:25.730
Tingzhou, what's wrong with you?

20:34.420 --> 20:36.070
Is my singing so awful?

20:37.570 --> 20:38.840
Why is is that you are still awake

20:38.870 --> 20:40.390
when everyone else has fallen asleep?

20:45.350 --> 20:46.550
Since you can see through me,

20:47.790 --> 20:48.710
you should know that

20:49.750 --> 20:51.060
if I want to hurt your brother,

20:51.080 --> 20:52.750
I can do it at the snap of my fingers.

20:54.510 --> 20:56.030
I've told you before that

20:57.310 --> 20:58.640
I really like him.

20:58.670 --> 21:00.310
I want to be with him forever.

21:00.600 --> 21:02.310
Why don't you believe me?

21:04.830 --> 21:06.290
Since you provoked me first

21:06.390 --> 21:08.070
and kept making things difficult for me,

21:09.400 --> 21:10.920
then you can't blame me

21:14.030 --> 21:15.230
for showing my hand either.

21:28.880 --> 21:30.320
You have quite a few tricks up your sleeve.

22:02.310 --> 22:02.990
My Lady!

22:06.160 --> 22:06.810
My Lady!

22:09.360 --> 22:10.360
My Lady, are you alright?

22:12.550 --> 22:13.710
Young Master is back.

22:18.310 --> 22:18.790
Grandmother.

22:19.360 --> 22:19.950
Mother.

22:20.400 --> 22:20.990
Yanqiu,

22:21.680 --> 22:22.920
why are you back?

22:23.640 --> 22:24.550
Where is the scoundrel?

22:25.160 --> 22:26.200
Have you found him?

22:26.710 --> 22:27.790
I chased him till we were out of the town,

22:27.990 --> 22:29.120
but we then lost track of the scoundrel.

22:29.310 --> 22:30.510
So, I came back first.

22:35.790 --> 22:36.990
You were frightened.

22:37.470 --> 22:38.680
Are you feeling better now?

22:39.310 --> 22:40.200
I am much better now.

22:40.880 --> 22:42.250
Thank you for your concern.

22:42.790 --> 22:43.750
Let me ask you something.

22:43.980 --> 22:45.100
It's about your sister-in-law.

22:48.030 --> 22:48.890
I heard from the servants that

22:48.950 --> 22:49.600
after I left,

22:49.920 --> 22:50.840
Manniang came to your place.

22:51.030 --> 22:51.680
Is that true?

22:52.880 --> 22:53.400
Yes.

22:53.950 --> 22:54.920
Then was she abducted by the scoundrel

22:54.920 --> 22:55.750
at your place?

22:56.710 --> 22:57.310
Yes.

22:58.080 --> 22:59.200
You two don't know each other well.

22:59.550 --> 23:00.790
Why did she come here?

23:02.030 --> 23:03.160
I don't know.

23:03.990 --> 23:06.470
The scoundrel came as soon as she entered.

23:08.440 --> 23:09.360
I heard from Tingzhou that

23:09.950 --> 23:10.600
when she woke up,

23:10.600 --> 23:11.470
she found you on the ground

23:11.640 --> 23:12.440
looking terrified and flustered.

23:12.950 --> 23:13.880
Since you were sober,

23:14.120 --> 23:15.360
did you see the scoundrel's face?

23:15.470 --> 23:16.280
Was it the same person

23:16.300 --> 23:16.970
from the last time?

23:20.950 --> 23:21.920
I didn't see him clearly.

23:22.310 --> 23:23.470
Why wouldn't you?

23:23.880 --> 23:25.030
The last time the scoundrel was came in,

23:25.030 --> 23:25.600
you were there too.

23:25.790 --> 23:26.880
This time, all of them

23:26.880 --> 23:27.680
even gathered in your room.

23:28.790 --> 23:30.470
Do you personally know that scoundrel?

23:30.920 --> 23:31.400
You...

23:31.640 --> 23:32.550
Enough.

23:33.790 --> 23:35.640
What are you talking about?

23:39.510 --> 23:40.400
Your sister is tired.

23:41.120 --> 23:42.360
Let her rest first.

23:42.880 --> 23:43.600
Grandmother,

23:44.260 --> 23:45.460
Manniang has been abducted.

23:45.750 --> 23:46.500
Her life is at risk.

23:46.530 --> 23:47.790
I need more information

23:47.910 --> 23:49.400
before I can find her.

23:51.680 --> 23:52.640
That scoundrel

23:53.510 --> 23:54.940
kept showing up

23:54.970 --> 23:56.060
over and over again

23:57.120 --> 23:58.310
because he is clearly

23:58.310 --> 23:59.710
coming for the two of you.

24:00.570 --> 24:02.010
What's the use of

24:02.040 --> 24:02.930
to interrogating your sister?

24:03.550 --> 24:05.140
She is a good lady who very rarely

24:05.260 --> 24:07.040
steps out of the house

24:07.310 --> 24:08.880
and has been living in Yuanzhou for a long time.

24:09.160 --> 24:10.950
How will she ever come to know of any scoundrel?

24:12.260 --> 24:14.150
But your bride instead

24:14.920 --> 24:16.320
was originally

24:16.400 --> 24:18.430
working in

24:18.450 --> 24:19.250
the brothel and taverns.

24:19.920 --> 24:21.190
It's little wonder what kind of people

24:21.220 --> 24:22.750
she would have gotten to know from outside.

24:23.120 --> 24:24.370
Even if you are now married,

24:24.550 --> 24:26.510
others still want to take her away alive.

24:26.880 --> 24:27.570
Grandmother!

24:27.710 --> 24:28.310
Enough.

24:28.640 --> 24:29.360
Say no more.

24:30.920 --> 24:31.710
Mother,

24:32.120 --> 24:33.250
Yanqiu was too anxious

24:33.310 --> 24:34.310
and lost his mind.

24:34.500 --> 24:35.790
I'll lead him away now.

24:37.840 --> 24:38.470
Banxia,

24:38.750 --> 24:39.790
rest well first.

24:40.160 --> 24:40.920
If there's anything, let's talk about it

24:41.360 --> 24:42.510
tomorrow morning instead.

24:51.230 --> 24:52.080
I'll take my leave.

24:54.640 --> 24:55.710
I've asked someone

24:55.920 --> 24:56.900
to warm up the calming tonic

24:56.920 --> 24:58.200
in the kitchen.

24:58.840 --> 25:00.990
If your lady wakes up in the middle of the night,

25:01.440 --> 25:02.880
give her another bowl.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.680
Yes, Madam.

25:06.600 --> 25:08.310
Your father is not home either.

25:10.310 --> 25:12.160
If you have any difficulties,

25:12.750 --> 25:14.230
you can just share it with me.

25:14.830 --> 25:17.590
I will help you.

25:20.310 --> 25:21.030
Grandmother,

25:21.750 --> 25:22.710
don't worry.

25:23.640 --> 25:25.160
I believe that in this world

25:25.790 --> 25:27.310
everything is based on karma.

25:28.160 --> 25:29.780
You've been kind to people all your life

25:29.880 --> 25:30.880
and you are blessed with abundant fortune.

25:31.530 --> 25:32.250
I am sure it will help to protect

25:32.270 --> 25:33.470
all of us in the younger generation.

25:35.510 --> 25:36.990
Everything will be fine.

26:09.550 --> 26:10.840
Where else do you want to go?

26:11.360 --> 26:12.400
This gentleman,

26:13.420 --> 26:14.480
we don't have any grudges in the past,

26:14.500 --> 26:15.450
neither did we have any grudges recently.

26:15.480 --> 26:17.480
Why must you make things difficult for me?

26:18.310 --> 26:19.640
Can't you let me go?

26:20.790 --> 26:21.990
How old are you?

26:22.020 --> 26:23.060
You're still so naive.

28:20.990 --> 28:22.310
I will be back.

28:35.680 --> 28:36.360
My Lady,

28:38.240 --> 28:38.920
it's already late.

28:38.950 --> 28:40.120
Why are you still up?

28:41.120 --> 28:42.360
I am preparing to fry some beans

28:42.510 --> 28:44.440
so that I can help Father to dye his hair when he is back.

28:45.440 --> 28:47.200
The Elder Master needs to dye his hair again?

28:47.950 --> 28:49.510
It hasn't been long since the last time.

28:53.360 --> 28:55.040
Are you not angry with Elder Master anymore?

28:59.710 --> 29:00.680
In my opinion,

29:00.990 --> 29:02.920
Mr. Li is actually quite nice.

29:03.290 --> 29:04.720
At the very least, we know each other well, right?

29:06.470 --> 29:07.550
You're still young.

29:07.710 --> 29:08.400
You don't understand.

29:09.840 --> 29:10.710
By the way, My Lady,

29:11.080 --> 29:11.790
you have a letter

29:11.790 --> 29:12.950
and I placed it on your desk.

29:16.120 --> 29:16.880
What letter?

29:18.710 --> 29:20.080
It was said that someone sent it

29:20.310 --> 29:21.600
and specified it should be handed to you.

29:24.120 --> 29:25.550
Did they mention who sent it?

29:26.840 --> 29:28.640
The servant at the door didn't tell me.

29:32.160 --> 29:33.640
Could it be written by Elder Master?

29:35.920 --> 29:37.160
Help me look after the pot.

29:37.190 --> 29:38.080
I'll go take a look.

30:24.160 --> 30:25.080
Where is this?

30:48.930 --> 30:49.930
Is anyone there?

30:54.450 --> 30:55.320
Don't you come over!

30:55.750 --> 30:56.880
My good little sister,

30:57.100 --> 30:58.820
where do you think you are going?

30:58.970 --> 31:01.200
Don't scare her. She's already terrified.

31:01.680 --> 31:02.610
What are you terrified of?

31:03.080 --> 31:05.080
I never wanted to hurt her.

31:05.480 --> 31:07.440
She provoked me first.

31:07.870 --> 31:09.320
You seduced her brother.

31:09.400 --> 31:10.730
Of course she won't be happy about it.

31:11.090 --> 31:12.330
What do you mean by seduce?

31:12.630 --> 31:14.260
We love each other.

31:14.300 --> 31:16.060
We should be together forever.

31:16.640 --> 31:17.710
She was the one who ruined

31:17.730 --> 31:18.690
this marriage first.

31:29.010 --> 31:29.890
My good little sister,

31:31.030 --> 31:32.220
how should I punish you

31:32.380 --> 31:34.210
for breaking up my marriage?

31:34.440 --> 31:36.090
Your throat is so beautiful.

31:36.110 --> 31:36.710
How about

31:37.080 --> 31:38.840
I eat it?

31:59.270 --> 32:00.140
My good little sister,

32:00.810 --> 32:01.860
stop running.

32:02.580 --> 32:04.360
You can't run away from me.

32:20.710 --> 32:22.230
Why did she find me again?

32:25.470 --> 32:26.510
Something happened.

32:30.610 --> 32:31.570
It's you again!

32:32.360 --> 32:33.640
I'm the one who hurt you.

32:33.880 --> 32:34.640
How dare you

32:34.640 --> 32:35.680
vent your anger on others?

32:36.310 --> 32:37.840
I've never provoked you.

32:38.550 --> 32:39.990
Why are you haunting me

32:39.990 --> 32:41.360
and keep making things difficult for me?

32:42.710 --> 32:43.550
I have no choice.

32:44.120 --> 32:44.840
You are a demon.

32:45.080 --> 32:46.080
I'm a demon hunter.

32:46.470 --> 32:47.270
You did something bad.

32:47.270 --> 32:48.120
Isn't it natural for me

32:48.120 --> 32:49.200
to make things difficult for you?

32:50.010 --> 32:51.230
I told you

32:51.250 --> 32:52.640
I don't want to hurt anyone this time.

32:53.830 --> 32:55.750
You've gone too far.

33:12.120 --> 33:13.080
Tell him that

33:14.640 --> 33:17.840
although I have hurt countless of people,

33:19.880 --> 33:21.800
I never wanted to hurt him.

33:25.240 --> 33:25.920
I...

33:28.550 --> 33:30.300
really liked him.

33:42.840 --> 33:43.640
Is she dead?

33:45.270 --> 33:45.920
She's dead.

33:46.640 --> 33:47.550
Will she come back alive?

33:48.950 --> 33:49.600
No.

33:54.630 --> 33:56.990
[Duan's Mansion]

33:59.950 --> 34:00.550
Young Master,

34:00.950 --> 34:01.750
she's awake now.

34:04.400 --> 34:05.400
You can do away with the formalities.

34:10.750 --> 34:11.350
Last night,

34:11.380 --> 34:12.750
you fainted in front of Shengping Theater

34:13.300 --> 34:14.080
and was found by officials

34:14.199 --> 34:14.960
who sent you back.

34:16.600 --> 34:17.560
That day,

34:17.860 --> 34:18.909
I was too reckless.

34:19.270 --> 34:20.350
Please don't take it to heart.

34:24.010 --> 34:25.110
I heard from the maid that

34:25.480 --> 34:26.350
a few days ago,

34:26.480 --> 34:27.520
when Manniang was bedridden,

34:28.000 --> 34:28.909
you had went to see her?

34:32.639 --> 34:33.480
She don't come from a good background

34:34.120 --> 34:35.199
and everyone looks down on her.

34:36.159 --> 34:37.230
I thank you

34:37.600 --> 34:38.790
on her behalf.

34:39.460 --> 34:40.480
I believe that night,

34:40.510 --> 34:41.780
Manniang went to find you

34:42.159 --> 34:43.199
because she was also feeling moody

34:43.639 --> 34:44.750
and wanted to chat with you.

34:46.710 --> 34:48.480
We didn't expect that she would meet the scoundrel.

34:49.960 --> 34:51.350
But after all, you are a woman without much strength yourself.

34:51.750 --> 34:52.350
The scoundrel

34:52.350 --> 34:53.480
is still at large.

34:53.639 --> 34:54.710
It was too dangerous for you

34:54.870 --> 34:55.480
to go to a place like

34:55.480 --> 34:56.679
Shengping Theater

34:57.080 --> 34:58.230
to find her all by yourself.

34:59.960 --> 35:00.870
I'm her husband

35:01.600 --> 35:02.560
and an official.

35:02.910 --> 35:03.580
I will find her back

35:03.600 --> 35:04.830
through both official and unofficial means.

35:06.080 --> 35:06.770
So,

35:06.790 --> 35:07.750
don't you worry anymore.

35:10.760 --> 35:11.850
I understand.

35:14.870 --> 35:15.710
I have work to do.

35:16.230 --> 35:16.960
I'm leaving.

35:18.020 --> 35:18.940
Brother.

35:21.150 --> 35:22.270
If...

35:23.090 --> 35:24.720
we can never find sister-in-law

35:26.120 --> 35:27.630
ever again,

35:28.430 --> 35:29.640
what would you do?

35:34.290 --> 35:35.090
Don't think too much.

35:35.650 --> 35:36.330
Have a good rest.

36:03.630 --> 36:04.880
The one who rears rabbits!

36:09.080 --> 36:10.150
The one who rears rabbits!

36:12.230 --> 36:13.630
The one who rears rabbits!

36:16.600 --> 36:18.080
The one who rears rabbits!

36:22.830 --> 36:23.520
Who are you?

36:23.900 --> 36:25.110
Where did this little thief come from?

36:26.120 --> 36:27.560
You! Stop right there!

36:27.790 --> 36:28.430
Stop!

36:29.090 --> 36:30.050
Stop!

36:30.520 --> 36:31.640
The one who rears rabbits!

36:35.580 --> 36:36.810
The one who rears rabbits?

36:42.200 --> 36:43.750
I don't rear rabbits.

36:44.940 --> 36:45.750
My surname is Jiu,

36:45.870 --> 36:46.750
and my name is Xuanye.

36:47.680 --> 36:49.430
My surname is Duan, name is Banxia.

36:50.480 --> 36:51.350
I know.

36:56.230 --> 36:57.000
What is this?

36:59.710 --> 37:00.430
It's for you.

37:03.270 --> 37:03.910
Food?

37:08.580 --> 37:09.210
Anything else?

37:12.600 --> 37:13.230
I am talking about food.

37:16.870 --> 37:18.180
You have ate all the food I brought,

37:19.410 --> 37:20.240
but I have some more at home.

37:22.270 --> 37:23.080
Forget it.

37:26.960 --> 37:28.080
You can really eat.

37:30.200 --> 37:31.230
What brings you here?

37:34.310 --> 37:35.630
I wanted to ask

37:36.210 --> 37:38.620
if my sister-in-law is really dead?

37:40.310 --> 37:41.230
Her soul is gone

37:41.450 --> 37:42.430
and she died a thorough death.

37:42.960 --> 37:43.870
Even the presence of the Great Immortal

37:43.870 --> 37:44.830
can't save her.

37:45.500 --> 37:47.460
You don't have to worry about this anymore.

37:50.750 --> 37:51.430
What's up?

37:52.080 --> 37:54.560
You seem to miss her.

37:55.120 --> 37:56.230
Not really.

37:58.080 --> 38:00.640
So did Manniang marry my brother

38:01.210 --> 38:02.310
just to

38:02.310 --> 38:03.480
to take his voice?

38:05.790 --> 38:07.000
That I don't know.

38:07.840 --> 38:09.360
What she thinks has nothing to do with me.

38:10.270 --> 38:11.940
I only know demons

38:12.160 --> 38:13.000
could be good or bad.

38:13.790 --> 38:15.480
If it has the thoughts to kill,

38:15.870 --> 38:17.310
or to disturb people's safety,

38:17.680 --> 38:18.870
we must kill them all

38:19.200 --> 38:20.200
to prevent future troubles.

38:23.520 --> 38:24.310
I advise you

38:24.430 --> 38:25.680
not to think too much.

38:26.830 --> 38:28.200
When you have such eyes,

38:28.600 --> 38:29.230
you are bound to come across demons

38:29.390 --> 38:31.200
in this life.

38:31.750 --> 38:33.790
Demons are good at bewitching people.

38:34.310 --> 38:35.710
If you don't raise your guard,

38:36.080 --> 38:37.560
you'll fall into their trap sooner or later.

38:44.080 --> 38:44.710
Alright.

38:44.960 --> 38:46.030
I’m going back to Guangping.

38:46.640 --> 38:47.680
Do you have any plans?

38:49.680 --> 38:50.600
Plans?

38:51.870 --> 38:52.660
Are you going to

38:52.690 --> 38:54.160
keep smelling this calming fragrance

38:54.390 --> 38:55.680
and lie to yourself that

38:55.980 --> 38:57.020
there are no demons in this world?

38:59.390 --> 39:00.200
My family

39:00.230 --> 39:01.830
don't like me to be seeing those things.

39:03.790 --> 39:04.750
What about you?

39:06.000 --> 39:07.430
I don't like it either.

39:08.680 --> 39:09.800
This time, it was my brother

39:09.820 --> 39:10.800
was stalked by a demon,

39:10.820 --> 39:11.740
so I had no choice.

39:13.020 --> 39:14.060
But I won't always

39:14.350 --> 39:15.830
be so unlucky, right?

39:18.120 --> 39:18.870
Maybe.

39:19.870 --> 39:20.600
But doing so,

39:20.770 --> 39:22.170
you're just deceiving yourself.

39:22.870 --> 39:23.910
You can fool yourself for a while,

39:24.430 --> 39:25.520
but not forever.

39:26.200 --> 39:27.600
But what can I do?

39:29.270 --> 39:31.230
Am I supposed to be a demon hunter like you?

39:34.160 --> 39:35.710
I'm not that capable.

39:36.910 --> 39:38.680
I just want to be an ordinary person

39:39.560 --> 39:40.640
and live a good life.

39:45.430 --> 39:46.200
Give me your hand.

39:50.070 --> 39:50.990
Give me your hand.

40:24.230 --> 40:24.870
Done.

40:28.560 --> 40:29.960
This is the self-protection seal.

40:30.200 --> 40:31.000
I created it.

40:31.750 --> 40:32.550
Even if you meet

40:32.570 --> 40:33.810
a demon who has been cultivated for a 100 years,

40:33.970 --> 40:34.880
you will still stand a fighting chance.

40:37.080 --> 40:37.640
In the future,

40:38.080 --> 40:39.640
if you encounter any trouble,

40:40.160 --> 40:41.410
you can come to Guangping City to find me.

40:43.350 --> 40:44.560
Guangping City?

40:46.490 --> 40:47.760
Where do you live?

40:48.430 --> 40:49.910
Do you live alone?

40:50.200 --> 40:51.310
Or with your family?

40:52.640 --> 40:53.430
I have no family.

40:54.200 --> 40:55.350
If you come to Guangping,

40:55.600 --> 40:56.540
you can come to Sifang Street,

40:56.560 --> 40:57.340
Changping Alley.

40:57.400 --> 40:58.350
Find me at Ganshan Clinic.

41:00.390 --> 41:01.640
Ganshan Clinic?

41:02.000 --> 41:03.230
Although I am a demon hunter,

41:03.350 --> 41:04.560
I am also a physician.

41:05.000 --> 41:06.710
Ganshan Clinic is my pharmacy.

41:11.710 --> 41:12.350
Do you

41:12.710 --> 41:13.750
anything else to ask?

41:15.710 --> 41:16.430
No.

41:17.790 --> 41:18.520
Go back then.

41:26.870 --> 41:28.120
Thank you for today.

41:28.910 --> 41:29.910
I'll get going then.

41:39.520 --> 41:40.480
She's so bold.

41:43.480 --> 41:44.430
She's a girl,

41:45.230 --> 41:46.870
yet she's not afraid of such a dark mountain road.

42:43.160 --> 42:44.340
♫Captured in the mirror♫

42:44.360 --> 42:48.030
♫The phantom of the moon♫

42:51.460 --> 42:56.150
♫ What's in the destiny to be quelled♫

42:58.570 --> 43:00.660
♫Don't wake up the person dreaming♫

43:00.990 --> 43:02.530
♫Within the clouds and mist♫

43:02.610 --> 43:06.030
♫I carefully imprint your face♫

43:08.050 --> 43:13.290
♫To resist the piercing edge of the long night♫

43:15.290 --> 43:19.290
♫I can stand in that forest♫

43:19.480 --> 43:20.880
♫Waiting for a hundred years♫

43:20.910 --> 43:23.290
♫Hoping to meet you again♫

43:23.600 --> 43:30.640
♫Through the long night, the light shines bright♫

43:31.000 --> 43:35.900
♫I want to fly across earth and sink into the sea♫

43:35.920 --> 43:37.580
♫And across the mountains and rivers♫

43:37.600 --> 43:39.760
♫Just to see you♫

43:40.000 --> 43:46.970
♫And stay in dream forever♫
